    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0cd9d321-9aa7-5010-b073-7e92a7909dec" activityNameId="85223e41-545d-53b9-97a2-4234dc807037" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant
na;
UUID: 7f871600-f979-37d6-98be-1d39088c3dae
This module includes the production of corrugated board out of the corrugated base papers. The following steps are included: energy production, corrugated board production itself, waste water treatment.; Geography: Estimation based on average data from European producers, collecte from FEFCO
Location: Estimation based on average data from European producers, collecte from FEFCO
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: In FEFCO only a combined board and box production is show. For this study this has been split into two different datasets.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7f871600-f979-37d6-98be-1d39088c3dae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
